# ── Unified Runtime Build Context ─────────────────────────────────
# Keeps tests, caches, local state, and obsolete standalone image recipes out
#   of the single Cyberful engagement-runtime build context.
# → mcps/cyberful-os/Dockerfile — consumes the remaining first-party sources.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/tests
browser
package-lock.json
cyberful-os/docker-compose.yml
cyberful-os/Dockerfile
ghidra/Dockerfile
ghidra/Dockerfile.bridge
zap/Dockerfile
zap/Dockerfile.bridge
zap/*.test.mjs
